SUMMARY:CPR Training with Beat to Breathe CPR
DESCRIPTION:June is National CPR and AED Awareness Month! Come take a free 
 basic CPR training class with Div\, Andrea and Jada from Beat to Breathe 
 CPR.\n\n\nFree training class for layperson CPR knowledge. Please be 
 advised this is not a certification course.\n\nABOUT BEAT TO BREATHE 
 CPR\n\nAs a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit\, Beat to Breathe CPR is 
 dedicated to enhancing community health and safety by providing 
 affordable\, accessible CPR training to individuals of all ages and 
 backgrounds. Established in 2022\, we have remained committed to empowering 
 every student with life-saving skills and fostering a community that is 
 confident and prepared to respond effectively in emergencies.\n\nPLEASE 
 NOTE: A second date has been scheduled on August 13 due to popular demand. 
 To register\, please follow this link.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Auditorium
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Library":MAILTO:events@montclairlibrary.org
