SUMMARY:Teen Summer Reading Kickoff (ages 10 )
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the start of Summer Reading with a visit from our 
 friends\, Primetime Gaming – their video game truck will be visiting the 
 Library from 3 to 5pm! They’re bringing a wide selection of games for you 
 to play with your friends\, so you won’t want to miss it!\nWe can fit 
 about 28 participants in the game truck at a time\, so space is available 
 on a first come/first served basis. But don't worry\; we're going to make 
 sure that everyone gets a chance to play!\n\n\n\nThe truck will be parked 
 on the side of the Library in the alley leading back to the parking lot. 
 Follow the signs to find us!\n\nThe 2026 Summer Reading program has been 
 generously funded by a grant from The William H. and Judith C. Turner 
 Family Foundation.
