SUMMARY:Create a Summery Flower Arrangement NEW
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nCreate a bright and beautiful seasonal centerpiece in our 
 “Create a Summery Flower Arrangement” workshop. Perfect for beginners 
 and flower lovers alike\, this hands-on class will guide you through the 
 essentials of floral design using fresh summer blooms and lush greenery. 
 You’ll learn how to select the best seasonal flowers\, master simple 
 mechanics for building a balanced and long-lasting arrangement\, and take 
 home practical tips for caring for your flowers after the workshop. Leave 
 with a stunning arrangement and the confidence to create your own floral 
 designs at home.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Classroom\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Arts & Crafts
