SUMMARY:Beyond Beginner Mah Jongg - Mon Afternoon NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nYou learned the basics\, what's next? In this class\, we will 
 go over Charleston strategies\, how to pick a hand\, when to expose or when 
 to wait plus learn some skill building exercises you can do at home. 
 Whether you’re looking to enhance your game or simply gain confidence\, 
 this is your chance to build on the skills that you learned in the Beginner 
 class and get to the next level. \n\nNOTE: If you know you cannot attend 
 any of the first 3 sessions\, please do not register for this class.\n
