SUMMARY:Too-Hot-to-Cook Mediterranean Picnic: Demo\, Recipes and Tasting NEW
DESCRIPTION:Note: This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nJoin Donna Liotto-Scocozza of Firenze International Olive Oils 
 for a summer-friendly Mediterranean picnic class built around cool\, 
 colorful\, low- and no-cook recipes for the hottest days of the season. The 
 menu will include Cold Avocado Soup with Cucumber\,\nLime & Extra-Virgin 
 Olive Oil\; Spicy Carrot Slaw with Citrus-Herb Vinaigrette\; Roasted Red 
 Pepper & Almond Picnic Spread\; Pan Bagnat-Style Salmon Picnic Sandwich\; 
 and Five-Minute Fudge Snackin’ Cake. Throughout the class\, Donna will 
 share practical tips for using extra-virgin olive oil to add flavor\, 
 freshness\, and balance to warm-weather meals.
